                              applications only)
                -PP _X,_Y        window position in screen pixels
                -HH            start hidden

     One further key chord lives in the display driver itself, so
     it works even when the server is hung: AALLTT+CCTTRRLL+HHEELLPP for-
     cibly unloads the driver and shuts the desktop down - the
     emergency exit for a hung screen.

FFIILLEESS
                  /etc/wgui             if present, rc starts the GUI
                  /usr/hr/etc/apps      launcher-menu catalog
                  /usr/hr/etc/dock      the dock's catalog (see zdock)
                  /usr/hr/etc/rc        desktop start-up script
                  /usr/hr/icons/*.icn   icons
                  /usr/hr/fonts/*.hf    fonts
                  /drv/hr, /drv/pty     drivers, loaded at start-up
                  /wscrash              crash status of a dead server

