     (which must equal the application's declared title),
     program, whether many copies may run (1) or one (0), and ex-
     tra command-line arguments (blank-separated) passed to the
     program at launch; the last two fields are optional, and #
     starts a comment.  The dock's icon bar is configured
     separately, in /uussrr/hhrr/eettcc/ddoocckk (see zzddoocckk), so the menu and
     the dock are independent lists.  The rrcc script runs at
     desktop start-up; it starts the dock and anything else that
     should be resident from the beginning; each command must end
