NNOOTTEESS
     At most 16 windows can be open and the catalog holds at most
     12 applications.  The screen is 1024x800 pixels; windows are
     clamped to it.  Applications are best launched from the dock
     or the desktop menu rather than made resident in rrcc: a dock
     icon costs no memory until it is clicked.
